The flush-left line after a container a quoted line opened

```
> quote
> ::: note
tail
.
<blockquote><p>quote
::: note
tail</p></blockquote>
```

```
> quote
> ::: note
>
> :::
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <p>quote
::: note</p>
  <div>
  </div>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> quote
> ::: note
> body
> :::
tail
.
<blockquote><p>quote
::: note
body
:::
tail</p></blockquote>
```

```
> quote
> :::note
> body
:::
.
<blockquote><p>quote
:::note
body
:::</p></blockquote>
```
